 "notes": "Two official sources. (1) Legacy portal us.owners.infinitiusa.com/owners/navigation/manualsAndGuides: plain HTML, no login, lists per model-year PDF links on owners.infinitiusa.com (which redirects to admin.owners.infinitiusa.com; resolved_url recorded) for MY2014-2019 (how=linked). Its QX70 owner's-manual links (FX/20xx/20xx-QX70-owner-manual.pdf) are dead (404), so QX70 manuals come from site search (admin.owners.infinitiusa.com/.../QX70/2014/... and www DAM .../qx70/2015-2017/...). (2) MY2020+ owner's manuals and warranty booklets on the www.infinitiusa.com DAM (manuals_guides/{model}/{year}/{year}-infiniti-{model}-owner-manual.pdf; shared/{year}/{year}-infiniti-warranty-booklet.pdf), found by search restricted to infinitiusa.com and extended by verified pattern. www.infinitiusa.com robots.txt disallows *_jcr_content*; no such endpoints were called. All PDFs verified by GET Range bytes=0-1023 (206, %PDF / application/pdf). US editions (INFINITI Americas; US owners portal). JX35 is MY2013 only (renamed QX60 for 2014), so it is outside 2014-2026; the 2013 JX documents exist on the portal (JX/2013/2013-jx35-owner-manual.pdf) but were not collected. FX was renamed QX70 for 2014; QX70 documents sit under the FX folder on the legacy host. Hybrid variants included (Q50 Hybrid 2014-2018, QX60 Hybrid 2014-2017) with their hybrid warranty/maintenance booklets. Separate Service & Maintenance Guide exists 2014-2016 only; from 2016/2017 the owner's manual is 'Owner's Manual and Maintenance Information'. Navigation/InTouch manuals, QRGs, towing guides not collected.",
